returns at once: Ok(1)
returns at once, negative: Ok(1)
computes a little: Ok(100)
sends into room: Ok(())
receives, a value is there: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
tries to receive, a value is there: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
selects, a value is there: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
receives, nothing is there: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
receives, nothing is there, negative: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
sleeps: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
computes on: Err(the function was ended by its deadline)
what was sent is there: Message(1)
what was there is still there: Message(7) Message(8)
and nothing else: Empty Empty
